	(text "J3 = interface to the main board (2x9, 1.27 mm, keyed).\nNet names are the LEFT-half meaning; the right half remaps in firmware.\nPins 1+17 = LED_MCU (mirror pair), 3 = HAND, 15 = GND, 18 = SPARE.\nFull pinout + right-half map: NOTES.md, 2026-11-10."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
